{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514090?t=1768050024","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/36cd9493ca8847327e9350a56c51fce3bc82bcf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768050024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/75afec17ef1704adda22fbc73a4b1788586d3e42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768050024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/75afec17ef1704adda22fbc73a4b1788586d3e42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768050024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3899790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.poster.avif?t=1768050024\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.webm?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.mp4?t=1768050024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>","developers":["NoiseHum Games"],"dlc":[4187040],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/0b4342915230377d5d0c0bc19f9d7003ee4e75c4/header.jpg?t=1768050024","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514090/1397898454/1caf811265493e6a1bf9b282ed8f828a273bc2e2/1754308359/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754386416","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514090/1397898454/1caf811265493e6a1bf9b282ed8f828a273bc2e2/1754308359/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754386416","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"ht